	(text "K1 RELAY VARIANT: see README.md for contacts and coil timing.\nGlass66x66mm; optical opening50x50mm (routed corners); ENIG contacts5x50mm.\nThree PHB1.5F/5V packs in parallel; no DAC / Teensy / audio adaptor / LLM.\nSet JP1 OFF BEFORE USB: LOLIN USB VBUS and its5V header are the same node.\nDSSC Voc~0.65V / Isc~34mA are separate endpoints; Pmpp unmeasured. CAD consistency is not bench qualification."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
